WEBVTT

00:00:01.952 --> 00:00:02.564
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.555 --> 00:00:05.846
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>Wait</b> for me outside the station.

00:00:07.491 --> 00:00:08.110
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.214 --> 00:00:10.818
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What did you <b>think</b> of the meal?

